# Nx's raw FSEvents watcher ignores .gitignore (to observe task outputs and .env files)
# and only excludes .nxignore paths. Keep agent worktrees and .env pipes (e.g. 1Password
# Environments FIFOs, which block or emit watch events when opened) out of Nx's walker/watcher.
.claude/worktrees
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
